# fcop-cadence-golden/v1 (line form): shared by the .NET xUnit suite and the C host harness.
# The C side runs the ORIGINAL func_8006C3E0 (timer decrement) and func_8006BA50 (trigger logic)
# with stubs for the registry lookup and the fire dispatcher; every row lists the frames in which
# the dispatcher was called.
# Columns (decimal):
#   caseName burst reload gap cycle delta frames count fireFrames...
#   burst   = entry +0x06 (u8), shots per reload cycle
#   reload  = entry +0x08 (s16), reload timer added when the cycle ends
#   gap     = entry +0x0A (s16), timer added after each shot inside the cycle (may be negative)
#   cycle   = initial value of the +0x93 cycle counter (record + 0x0A in retail)
#   delta   = ticks per frame (gFrameId, >= 5 and capped at 0x3C)

